102-From the 2026-11-06 readiness audit (FINDINGS section D, A4). `maxContextTokens` is never consumed, `validateSpecialistOutput` has no runtime caller, required inputs are prompt advice only, and the independent-review verdict gate covers reviewer units only. Enforce ceilings at admission, validate inputs and results through the operation executor, retain raw rejected output, add tests through the executor.
