107-A Rust CLI `wt` (v0.81.0, pre-1.0, MIT OR Apache-2.0, about 12 releases in 83 days with breaking changes in each). Branch-addressed `switch/list/remove/merge`, a configurable path template (default sibling `repo.branch`), `copy-ignored` build-cache sharing with `.worktreeinclude`, hooks (`pre-start/post-start/pre-merge/...`), per-branch variables, aliases, PR checkout, CI status, LLM commit messages, a picker, and Claude Code and Codex plugins. It shells out to `git`. Its library crate is declared unstable.
